# Implementation Plan - Update UI Components

## Goal
1.  **Order Estimation Dialog**: Change the "Predicted Test Total" display to "Current Completed Total".
2.  **Thimble Usage Reminder**: Ensure the dialog opens maximized and content is fully visible.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> In `Order Estimation Dialog`, the "Predicted Total" (how many tests are required to finish the order) will be **replaced** by "Current Completed Total" (how many tests have been run so far for this order) as requested. This changes the focus of that label from prediction to status.

