#### [MODIFY] [order_estimation_dialog.py](file:///c:/Users/zhangch64/Desktop/PythonTest/order_estimation_dialog.py)
*   Update [_calculate_estimation](file:///c:/Users/zhangch64/Desktop/PythonTest/order_estimation_dialog.py#336-397) (and potentially [_load_historical_data](file:///c:/Users/zhangch64/Desktop/PythonTest/order_estimation_dialog.py#287-335)) to:
